A '''Cod''' is a [[Critter]] that can be found on the [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Spawning ==
'''Cod''' spawn in water in the {{zone|Murkwater Loch}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Cod''' swim alone or in schools. When the player throws a [[Fishing Net]], they begin to spin. Throwing a [[Fishing Net]] again increases the '''Cod's''' spin meter. Upon reaching {{Green|90%}}, the '''Cod''' faints and drops a {{Item|Cod Shard}}. Going over {{Green|100%}} causes the '''Cod''' to explode and award nothing.

